            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Porphyra capensis is a species of red algae in the family of Bangiaceae. Its name stems from it being first described from a sample taken from the Cape of Good Hope. In addition to the coasts of South Africa, it has also been observed growing along the coasts of Namibia."
